1a Council Regulation (EU) 2025/2600 of 12 December 2025 on emergency measures addressing the serious economic difficulties caused by Russia’s actions in the context of the war of aggression against Ukraine (OJ L, 2025/2600, 13.12.2025, ELI:[http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2025/2600/oj](http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2025/2600/oj)).
